<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
	<title>Privacy Policy | GridPermit</title>
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
	<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
	<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
	<nav class="navbar">
		<div class="nav-container">
			<a href="/" class="brand-logo">Grid<strong>Permit</strong></a>
		</div>
	</nav>

	<main class="legal-container">
		<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="updated">Last Updated: July 2026</p>

		<p>At GridPermit ("we", "our", or "us"), we are committed to protecting your privacy and complying with California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) guidelines. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and share information when you use our energy evaluation tools and forms.</p>

		<h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
		<p>When you use our solar and battery calculator or request quote matches, we may collect personal information including your ZIP code, estimated monthly electric bill, full name, email address, and phone number.</p>

		<h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
		<p>We use your information to calculate estimated solar and battery savings, match you with certified local installers or affiliate partners, and contact you regarding your quote requests.</p>

		<h2>3. Sharing Your Information</h2>
		<p>By submitting a request for quotes on GridPermit, you consent to allow us to share your contact details with trusted third-party energy partners and installers to fulfill your audit request.</p>

		<h2>4. California Consumer Rights (CCPA)</h2>
		<p>California residents have the right to request access to or deletion of their personal information at any time. You may opt out of data sharing by contacting us directly.</p>

		<a href="/" class="btn-back">← Back to Calculator</a>
	</main>

	<style>
		:root { --primary: #2563eb; --bg: #f8fafc; --text: #0f172a; }
